            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n2176",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 自动翻译用现有的「联系人名称译中文」（登记商机时已经在用），不另外配置；只在中文名为空、英文名不含中文时才翻译。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n2177",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 翻译在保存之后进行，不影响保存速度；AI 未配置或翻译失败时中文名留空，可以手动补。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n2178",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 主联系人的中文名同步到客户的「主联系人中文名」，客户列表显示这一列；批量导入、历史迁移的客户不自动翻译。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n2179",
              "width": 1640.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· PI、报价单等发给客户的单据仍只用英文名。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
